e 1951, more than any other pair. In 2025 on the middle, January to February came in at 32% of normal, while June to July hit 193%. So far in 2026, January to February sits at 14% of normal on the middle. Grid 27134 had its driest year in 1976 at 53% of normal.</p>"}
